# The image copies the standalone server `mvn clean verify` builds, and nothing else of the host: the
# standalone directory carries the server, its traced dependencies and the public files, and the static
# directory carries the client assets the server answers with.
*
!.next/standalone
!.next/static
# Next.js copies the environment files it finds into the standalone directory, and a local .env holds the
# secrets of the machine it was written on; the container reads its own environment when it starts.
.next/standalone/.env*
